@EvidenceChain.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5059
@token = pega-aqui-el-accessToken
@evidenceId = 1
@transferId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@etag = "0x0000000000000000"

### Salud
GET {{EvidenceChain.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Usuarios demo (anónimo)
GET {{EvidenceChain.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/users
Accept: application/json

### Token (anónimo): usa un userName de la lista anterior
POST {{EvidenceChain.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userName": "c.rivas" }

### Bandeja (keyset)
GET {{EvidenceChain.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/evidence?pageSize=10&sort=desc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Detalle
GET {{EvidenceChain.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/evidence/{{evidenceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Línea de tiempo
GET {{EvidenceChain.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/evidence/{{evidenceId}}/chain
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Verificar cadena
GET {{EvidenceChain.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/evidence/{{evidenceId}}/chain/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Solicitar transferencia (Investigador o Supervisor). Copia el ETag de la respuesta.
POST {{EvidenceChain.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/custody-transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "evidenceId": {{evidenceId}}, "toCustodianId": 12, "reason": "Análisis en laboratorio" }

### Bandeja del custodio (token del custodio destinatario)
GET {{EvidenceChain.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/custody-transfers?status=pending&mine=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Aceptar (token del custodio destinatario, If-Match con el ETag vigente)
POST {{EvidenceChain.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/custody-transfers/{{transferId}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
If-Match: {{etag}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "note": "Recibido en bóveda" }

### Rechazar
POST {{EvidenceChain.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/custody-transfers/{{transferId}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
If-Match: {{etag}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "note": "Sin espacio en bóveda" }
